@startgantt
' SmartExam project Gantt chart -- 8 sprints x 4 weeks (Weeks 1-32)
' Matches Chapter-1-8 (sprint steps), Chapter-2-2 (tab:timeframe) and
' Chapter-3-3 (tab:cpm, activities A-I). One time unit = one project week.
' Render: java -jar plantuml.jar -tpng gantt_chart.puml
skinparam dpi 150
<style>
ganttDiagram {
  BackgroundColor white
  FontName Arial
  task {
    FontName Arial
    FontSize 10
    FontColor black
    BackGroundColor #BDBDBD
    LineColor #4D4D4D
  }
  milestone {
    FontName Arial
    FontSize 10
    FontStyle bold
    FontColor #B03A2E
    BackGroundColor #B03A2E
    LineColor #B03A2E
  }
  separator {
    FontName Arial
    FontSize 10
    FontStyle bold
    LineColor #9E9E9E
  }
  timeline {
    FontName Arial
    FontSize 9
    BackgroundColor #F5F5F5
  }
  arrow {
    LineColor #9E9E9E
  }
  title {
    FontName Arial
    FontSize 13
    FontStyle bold
  }
}
footer {
  FontName Arial
  FontSize 10
  FontColor #333333
  HorizontalAlignment left
  Margin 4
}
</style>
title SmartExam Schedule: 8 Sprints x 4 Weeks (timeline in project weeks 1-32)

-- Sprint 1 (Weeks 1-4) --
[A: Requirements, use cases, backlog, architecture, scope approval] as [A] lasts 4 days

-- Sprint 2 (Weeks 5-8) --
[B: M1 Authentication and device binding (HWID, JWT)] as [B] lasts 4 days
[B] starts at [A]'s end
[C: M7 User and role management (2 weeks + 2 weeks float)] as [C] lasts 2 days
[C] starts at [A]'s end
[C] is colored in #E6E6E6/#4D4D4D

-- Sprint 3 (Weeks 9-12) --
[D: M8 Exam creation and configuration] as [D1] lasts 4 days
[D1] starts at [B]'s end
[D: M9 Eligibility, attendance and seats] as [D2] lasts 4 days
[D2] starts at [B]'s end

-- Sprint 4 (Weeks 13-16) --
[E: M2 Readiness check and practice exams] as [E1] lasts 4 days
[E1] starts at [D1]'s end
[E: M3 Student exam dashboard] as [E2] lasts 4 days
[E2] starts at [D1]'s end
[E: M4 Secure exam environment (lockdown)] as [E3] lasts 4 days
[E3] starts at [D1]'s end
[FYP-1 mid-project review (Week 16)] happens at [E1]'s end

-- Sprint 5 (Weeks 17-20) --
[F: M5 Monitoring client (heartbeats, screenshots)] as [F1] lasts 4 days
[F1] starts at [E1]'s end
[F: M10 Live proctoring dashboard (SignalR)] as [F2] lasts 4 days
[F2] starts at [E1]'s end

-- Sprint 6 (Weeks 21-24) --
[G: M6 Autosave, encrypted backup, submission] as [G1] lasts 4 days
[G1] starts at [F1]'s end
[G: M11 Test-case grading, TF-IDF, plagiarism] as [G2] lasts 4 days
[G2] starts at [F1]'s end

-- Sprint 7 (Weeks 25-28) --
[H: M12 Audit logs, analytics, QuestPDF reports] as [H] lasts 4 days
[H] starts at [G1]'s end

-- Sprint 8 (Weeks 29-32) --
[I: Integration and system testing (M1-M12)] as [I1] lasts 4 days
[I1] starts at [H]'s end
[I: Bug fixing, final report and demonstration] as [I2] lasts 4 days
[I2] starts at [H]'s end
[Final submission and demo (Week 32)] happens at [I2]'s end

footer Grey bars: work on the critical path (A-B-D-E-F-G-H-I). Light bar: C has 2 weeks of float. Red diamonds: milestones.
@endgantt
